  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5802.03 Blue smoke",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5802.03 “Blue smoke” means smoke emitted from the stack or engine area of a diesel-powered vehicle that, using the visible light spectrum as a guide, displays an obvious hue of the color blue.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
